WEBVTT

00:12.260 --> 00:14.590
<b>But do we have an audience, at least?</b>

00:14.970 --> 00:16.720
<b>Our goodies are great, though.</b>

00:16.890 --> 00:19.720
<b>You shouldn't have stuck us with such an unappealing name.</b>

00:20.100 --> 00:21.640
<b>Yeah, maybe.</b>

00:22.560 --> 00:24.690
<b><i>We have plenty of silicone bracelets!</i></b>

00:24.890 --> 00:26.900
<b><i>Who wants a Toge-Toge towel?</i></b>

00:28.110 --> 00:31.280
<b>We're doing better than we did back in Shin-Kawasaki.</b>

00:31.650 --> 00:32.610
<b>Are you sure about that?</b>

00:32.780 --> 00:35.990
<b>Relax, the Polaroids are selling like hotcakes.</b>

00:36.610 --> 00:37.990
<b>Is that good for you?</b>

00:38.320 --> 00:39.780
<b>Hug!</b>

00:40.910 --> 00:43.290
<b>I'll never wash again!</b>

00:43.660 --> 00:45.790
<b>It's your brain that's washed, yeah!</b>

00:46.000 --> 00:46.790
<b>Not wrong.</b>

00:47.130 --> 00:48.290
<b>Nonsense.</b>

00:50.300 --> 00:50.920
<b>Good evening.</b>

00:52.420 --> 00:56.050
<b>I'll leave you my contact information if you're interested.</b>

00:56.220 --> 00:59.050
<b>**SHIOMI MIURA**</b>

00:56.890 --> 00:59.050
<b>"Golden Archer"?</b>

00:59.680 --> 01:02.430
<b>- That's right.
- It rings a bell.</b>

01:04.350 --> 01:05.690
<b>It's an agency!</b>

01:08.980 --> 01:09.560
<b>Exactly!</b>

02:40.660 --> 02:45.370
<b>**WANDERVOGEL**</b>

02:41.070 --> 02:42.620
<b>Do you want to sign us?</b>

02:42.990 --> 02:45.370
<b>Yes, that's the purpose of my visit.</b>

02:46.330 --> 02:46.870
<b>Oh, really.</b>

02:47.450 --> 02:51.880
<b>You can look up our name; we're a well-established agency.</b>

02:52.380 --> 02:54.420
<b>- Do you know them?
- Sort of, yeah.</b>

02:54.590 --> 02:57.170
<b>They're popular with my friends.</b>

02:57.460 --> 02:59.260
<b>They produce several groups.</b>

02:59.420 --> 03:01.760
<b>Okay, but those kinds of organizations…</b>

03:02.090 --> 03:05.140
<b>Actually, I was a big fan of Diamond Dust.</b>

03:06.510 --> 03:09.520
<b>Only, I don't like the direction they've taken.</b>

03:09.680 --> 03:13.020
<b>They lost the brilliance that made them unique.</b>

03:13.360 --> 03:15.520
<b>I love Momoka's music.</b>

03:15.690 --> 03:18.780
<b>I want you to be able to compose what you want!</b>

03:19.490 --> 03:21.360
<b>And it's possible with this group!</b>

03:21.530 --> 03:22.410
<b>Definitely!</b>

03:23.370 --> 03:24.740
<b>Sit back down.</b>

03:24.910 --> 03:25.410
<b>OK.</b>

03:26.490 --> 03:28.700
<b>When DD reached a wider audience,</b>

03:28.870 --> 03:31.710
<b>I was made to understand that my compositions</b>

03:31.870 --> 03:33.920
<b>weren't really in tune with the times.</b>

03:34.380 --> 03:35.090
<b>I see.</b>

03:35.590 --> 03:37.880
<b>And honestly, they weren't wrong.</b>

03:38.550 --> 03:42.300
<b>In fact, the fans went along with it.</b>

03:43.470 --> 03:47.180
<b>But these four think they can outshine them.</b>

03:47.600 --> 03:50.430
<b>They think my songs can compete with theirs,</b>

03:51.060 --> 03:53.440
<b>and I intend to prove them right.</b>

03:54.810 --> 03:55.440
<b>Isn't that right?</b>

03:56.730 --> 03:57.440
<b>Momoka.</b>

03:57.860 --> 03:58.940
<b>Got it.</b>

03:59.400 --> 03:59.940
<b>What?</b>

04:00.610 --> 04:02.860
<b>You're participating in this festival, right?</b>

04:03.950 --> 04:06.450
<b>Making an impression, huh…</b>

04:06.620 --> 04:13.330
<b>**SHIOMI MIURA GOLDEN ARCHER**</b>

04:06.870 --> 04:08.870
<b>Let's say that if we make some noise,</b>

04:09.040 --> 04:11.580
<b>the agency will find us a label more easily.</b>

04:12.040 --> 04:16.880
<b>And by building a solid fanbase, we won't have to alter our music.</b>

04:17.750 --> 04:21.630
<b>This festival will be like an audition.</b>

04:22.220 --> 04:23.840
<b>- Nina.
- Yes?</b>

04:24.010 --> 04:27.600
<b>Could you think about the lyrics for this song?</b>

04:28.390 --> 04:28.890
<b>Me?</b>

04:30.100 --> 04:34.020
<b>I'm curious to see what my compositions inspire in you.</b>

04:35.440 --> 04:36.020
<b>OK.</b>

04:36.480 --> 04:38.270
<b>Honestly, I'm not feeling it.</b>

04:38.690 --> 04:41.570
<b>- Is she sure about this?
- I think it's good.</b>

04:42.030 --> 04:43.990
<b>They're on the same wavelength.</b>

04:47.120 --> 04:48.780
<b>So, those lyrics?</b>

04:49.160 --> 04:50.080
<b>I'm not making progress.</b>

04:50.240 --> 04:53.370
<b>Weren't you the one who had an idea in mind?</b>

04:54.000 --> 04:55.040
<b>Guilty.</b>

04:55.370 --> 04:57.250
<b>Then put it on paper.</b>

04:57.500 --> 04:58.920
<b>You can't understand.</b>

05:00.250 --> 05:02.840
<b>Words are a door to the outside.</b>

05:03.010 --> 05:04.590
<b>When we speak them,</b>

05:04.760 --> 05:08.680
<b>what's inside us materializes and no longer belongs to us.</b>

05:09.010 --> 05:10.970
<b>Do you know who you're talking to?</b>

05:11.140 --> 05:13.930
<b>How many songs do you think I've written?</b>

05:14.100 --> 05:15.190
<b>But ouch…</b>

05:15.520 --> 05:18.020
<b>I think I understand the basics.</b>

05:18.730 --> 05:20.150
<b>Come on, get to work.</b>

05:20.690 --> 05:22.150
<b>Already?</b>

05:26.910 --> 05:27.570
<b>What?</b>

05:28.110 --> 05:28.950
<b>Nothing.</b>

05:33.370 --> 05:34.330
<b>Hello…</b>

05:37.040 --> 05:38.290
<b>What's up?</b>

05:40.090 --> 05:41.710
<b>No… Impossible…</b>

05:43.250 --> 05:44.050
<b>Hurry up and…</b>

05:45.760 --> 05:46.970
<b>Hello.</b>

05:47.300 --> 05:48.050
<b>Tell me,</b>

05:48.220 --> 05:52.100
<b>a certain Iseri works here part-time.</b>

05:54.680 --> 05:57.140
<b>She's not here today.</b>

06:00.270 --> 06:03.070
<b>- Too bad.
- Do you want to see her?</b>

06:04.480 --> 06:06.360
<b>I guess you're Rupa.</b>

06:09.280 --> 06:10.870
<b>**MOM CAME! OH YEAH**</b>

06:09.570 --> 06:12.330
<b>You could have warned me, seriously.</b>

06:17.080 --> 06:17.620
<b>Dad?</b>

06:22.500 --> 06:23.250
<b>Nina?</b>

06:24.300 --> 06:26.130
<b>So you showed up at my place.</b>

06:27.220 --> 06:29.840
<b>I have to say, it feels great here.</b>

06:30.470 --> 06:32.640
<b>You don't even know why they came.</b>

06:32.890 --> 06:34.930
<b>Why don't you start by talking to them?</b>

06:35.600 --> 06:36.560
<b>Are you listening to me?</b>

06:41.150 --> 06:41.770
<b>Nina?</b>

06:42.150 --> 06:44.230
<b>We're really polar opposites.</b>

06:45.400 --> 06:47.990
<b>It's a bit like you and your grandmother.</b>

06:48.320 --> 06:50.530
<b>We don't see things the same way.</b>

06:50.700 --> 06:53.030
<b>They're spouting nonsense.</b>

06:53.620 --> 06:54.780
<b>Maybe, but…</b>

06:55.160 --> 06:58.000
<b>The priority is the lyrics.</b>

06:58.250 --> 07:00.540
<b>The festival is fast approaching.</b>

07:00.710 --> 07:05.050
<b>The future of the group depends on it. Anyway, I can't deal with this too.</b>

07:05.670 --> 07:08.380
<b>It mostly seems like you're trying to run away.</b>

07:11.510 --> 07:13.180
<b>So, are you staying here tonight?</b>

07:15.100 --> 07:31.820
<b>**THE NEXT DAY**</b>

07:19.140 --> 07:20.020
<b><i>Hello?</i></b>

07:20.980 --> 07:22.480
<b>Stop harassing me.</b>

07:22.650 --> 07:24.190
<b><i>You shouldn't have disappeared.</i></b>

07:24.860 --> 07:26.520
<b>That wasn't my intention.</b>

07:26.690 --> 07:31.150
<b>They keep calling me, asking if I know where you are.</b>

07:31.990 --> 07:38.580
<b><i>Recipient: Muneo Iseri Sender: Nina Iseri</i></b>

07:32.110 --> 07:33.110
<b><i>And what did you tell them?</i></b>

07:33.450 --> 07:35.950
<b>What did you expect by sending your letter?</b>

07:36.450 --> 07:38.370
<b>Of course, they were going to show up.</b>

07:39.250 --> 07:40.210
<b><i>But why?</i></b>

07:40.500 --> 07:42.710
<b>They weren't going to let it slide!</b>

07:43.290 --> 07:47.170
<b>Own up to it a bit and tell them the hard truth to their faces.</b>

07:49.260 --> 07:51.340
<b>Nina? She hung up.</b>

07:58.390 --> 07:59.020
<b>What?</b>

07:59.810 --> 08:01.770
<b>Did they change the locks?</b>

08:03.190 --> 08:04.850
<b>It's my apartment, you know!</b>

08:05.400 --> 08:07.150
<b>I want the new keys!</b>

08:09.530 --> 08:13.280
<b>Why is everyone freaking out at the end of the day?</b>

08:13.450 --> 08:14.320
<b>Lower your voice!</b>

08:14.490 --> 08:15.240
<b>But…</b>

08:15.950 --> 08:16.780
<b>Here, for you.</b>

08:18.950 --> 08:21.250
<b>We've lightened your schedule.</b>

08:22.040 --> 08:24.290
<b>Think of it as a gift from both of us.</b>

08:26.670 --> 08:29.500
<b>**TOKYO - KUMAMOTO**</b>

08:27.750 --> 08:28.670
<b>But why?</b>

08:30.510 --> 08:32.880
<b>Maybe Tomo already mentioned it to you.</b>

08:33.590 --> 08:36.510
<b>On the day of the accident, I was supposed to call my family.</b>

08:37.050 --> 08:39.600
<b>But my shift was longer than expected.</b>

08:40.270 --> 08:44.190
<b>I postponed it to the next day, thinking I had time.</b>

08:45.600 --> 08:46.900
<b>I'll never have it again.</b>

08:48.570 --> 08:52.280
<b>We have a lot less time and opportunities than we think.</b>

08:53.320 --> 08:55.280
<b>Sorry to make it all about me.</b>

08:57.820 --> 08:59.830
<b>Do you think they're worried?</b>

09:00.330 --> 09:02.540
<b>Up until now, they ignored me.</b>

09:05.120 --> 09:06.540
<b>I don't need a sound effect.</b>

09:07.250 --> 09:08.250
<b>Well.</b>

09:08.420 --> 09:10.300
<b>So that's your weakness.</b>

09:10.710 --> 09:12.920
<b>It's not about weakness.</b>

09:13.300 --> 09:15.300
<b>Then go see them.</b>

09:15.470 --> 09:16.840
<b>You too?</b>

09:17.010 --> 09:19.680
<b>I think you're just lost.</b>

09:21.640 --> 09:24.060
<b>Deep down, what haunts you</b>

09:24.430 --> 09:26.690
<b>isn't the exams or the harassment.</b>

09:27.400 --> 09:30.440
<b>It's the fact that your father turned a deaf ear to your distress.</b>

09:32.780 --> 09:33.820
<b>That's not it.</b>

09:34.320 --> 09:35.990
<b>Then there's no reason to avoid him.</b>

09:36.780 --> 09:37.820
<b>You're right.</b>

09:38.490 --> 09:42.080
<b>So go ahead. And don't come back until you've talked to him.</b>

09:44.950 --> 09:45.710
<b>See you.</b>

09:54.630 --> 09:55.720
<b>I’ve arrived…</b>

09:56.130 --> 09:59.470
<b><i>The train towards Suizenji and Hikarinomori…</i></b>

10:02.140 --> 10:05.980
<b>**TATSUTAGUCHI STATION**</b>

10:05.310 --> 10:05.980
<b>Let's get motivated.</b>

10:07.270 --> 10:08.650
<b>Three, two, one…</b>

10:19.950 --> 10:20.780
<b>Ouch!</b>

10:21.990 --> 10:22.740
<b>Naughty!</b>

10:29.920 --> 10:30.540
<b>Nina!</b>

10:34.920 --> 10:36.130
<b>We looked everywhere for you.</b>

10:37.970 --> 10:39.260
<b><i>Girls Band Cry.</i></b>

10:40.180 --> 10:42.010
<b><i>Family Principles</i></b>

10:41.300 --> 10:42.010
<b>A band?</b>

10:44.060 --> 10:46.310
<b>And you hope to make a living from it?</b>

10:46.730 --> 10:47.770
<b>Apparently.</b>

10:48.270 --> 10:51.400
<b>Her band was spotted by an agency.</b>

10:51.980 --> 10:54.480
<b>Soon, their career will take off.</b>

10:55.320 --> 10:57.110
<b>But, well, that remains to be seen.</b>

10:58.150 --> 11:00.160
<b>- It’s true.
- Well…</b>

11:00.490 --> 11:02.370
<b>You leave to study</b>

11:02.660 --> 11:05.870
<b>and start this project without telling us?</b>

11:06.490 --> 11:08.830
<b>She mentioned it to me.</b>

11:09.500 --> 11:12.170
<b>Did you think about your poor mother?</b>

11:14.790 --> 11:18.050
<b>Here we go again. As if you think about her.</b>

11:18.800 --> 11:23.300
<b>When I left, you told me to do what I wanted.</b>

11:23.760 --> 11:26.810
<b>And I told you I intended to.</b>

11:27.220 --> 11:27.970
<b>No.</b>

11:28.560 --> 11:30.640
<b>I told you to go to college.</b>

11:33.230 --> 11:36.110
<b>Do you realize everything we let you get away with?</b>

11:37.150 --> 11:40.320
<b>You wanted to quit school, we helped you.</b>

11:41.200 --> 11:43.660
<b>You wanted to go to Tokyo, we arranged it.</b>

11:44.530 --> 11:46.410
<b>I managed on my own.</b>

11:46.790 --> 11:48.080
<b>Don’t rewrite history!</b>

11:49.120 --> 11:51.750
<b>I decided to leave!</b>

11:51.960 --> 11:55.130
<b>You owe your studio to your mother.</b>

11:56.210 --> 11:59.010
<b>Who are your guarantors, remind me?</b>

12:00.010 --> 12:04.220
<b>You’re still a minor, you know what that means?</b>

12:04.840 --> 12:08.350
<b>An adult is always responsible for you.</b>

12:09.770 --> 12:11.980
<b>So I have to obey you?</b>

12:12.730 --> 12:15.480
<b>Pretend I was never bullied?</b>

12:16.610 --> 12:17.400
<b>Nina…</b>

12:17.650 --> 12:18.980
<b>No, I can’t.</b>

12:19.320 --> 12:20.820
<b>I came all this way</b>

12:21.190 --> 12:25.120
<b>hoping to open a dialogue, to be understood.</b>

12:25.370 --> 12:27.620
<b>But it's starting badly, very badly.</b>

12:27.950 --> 12:28.950
<b>I’ve had enough.</b>

12:30.540 --> 12:33.790
<b>I want you to come with me somewhere tomorrow.</b>

12:37.920 --> 12:38.630
<b>Tell me.</b>

12:40.050 --> 12:41.090
<b>Where are we going?</b>

12:43.220 --> 12:44.590
<b>You’ll find out soon enough.</b>

13:13.830 --> 13:14.660
<b>Without me.</b>

13:15.170 --> 13:17.080
<b>I don’t want to see that school again.</b>

13:17.290 --> 13:18.790
<b>I’ve already informed them.</b>

13:19.540 --> 13:24.090
<b>I want to clear things up too.</b>

13:25.800 --> 13:28.640
<b>Thank you for coming in this heat.</b>

13:26.840 --> 13:29.680
<b>**LETTER OF APOLOGY**</b>

13:29.100 --> 13:29.680
<b>It’s nothing.</b>

13:30.810 --> 13:32.310
<b>Could you explain?</b>

13:32.770 --> 13:35.810
<b>You must have been very hot too.</b>

13:36.310 --> 13:37.850
<b>- Let’s begin.
- Alright.</b>

13:38.150 --> 13:42.690
<b>We conducted our investigation, and the student admitted to the facts.</b>

13:43.780 --> 13:48.200
<b>I wanted to apologize for our lack of discernment.</b>

13:48.910 --> 13:52.330
<b>And that’s it? The school takes no responsibility?</b>

13:52.660 --> 13:54.700
<b>That’s not what I’m saying.</b>

13:54.950 --> 13:58.210
<b>But it would be wrong to call it bullying.</b>

13:58.580 --> 14:01.340
<b>I’m not the best person to talk about it,</b>

14:01.800 --> 14:04.710
<b>but the teaching staff knows perfectly well…</b>

14:05.050 --> 14:05.720
<b>Stop.</b>

14:06.380 --> 14:07.130
<b>Finally…</b>

14:07.380 --> 14:09.140
<b>That’s enough.</b>

14:10.510 --> 14:14.930
<b>We’re in the right. You’re the victim.</b>

14:17.390 --> 14:20.110
<b>I’m worried about Nina.</b>

14:20.560 --> 14:24.730
<b>Imagine she doesn’t come back… What do we do?</b>

14:25.610 --> 14:26.860
<b>Relax, it’ll be fine.</b>

14:28.820 --> 14:29.610
<b>Tomo!</b>

14:29.990 --> 14:31.240
<b>Are you okay?</b>

14:36.710 --> 14:37.540
<b>She'll be alright.</b>

14:39.040 --> 14:40.080
<b>Trust her.</b>

14:41.710 --> 14:42.500
<b>You're back.</b>

14:42.840 --> 14:43.630
<b>Yes.</b>

14:44.630 --> 14:45.920
<b>Are you staying for dinner?</b>

14:56.270 --> 14:57.930
<b>- Are you leaving already?
- Yes.</b>

14:58.980 --> 15:00.900
<b>So you're really going for it?</b>

15:01.520 --> 15:02.110
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:04.150 --> 15:05.690
<b>Do you like it that much?</b>

15:12.700 --> 15:13.990
<b>It's this song</b>

15:15.700 --> 15:18.580
<b>that gave me the courage I lacked.</b>

15:19.910 --> 15:23.790
<b>People kept telling me to grit my teeth, that it was common sense.</b>

15:24.090 --> 15:28.420
<b><i>Letter of introspection</i></b>

15:24.420 --> 15:28.420
<b>Naturally, I thought it was the only solution.</b>

15:28.590 --> 15:30.470
<b>Music helped me hold on.</b>

15:35.510 --> 15:38.930
<b>If I proved I was right, I wouldn't have to bite my tongue anymore.</b>

15:39.810 --> 15:44.270
<b>I wouldn't have to torment myself and could take the leap.</b>

15:44.980 --> 15:47.690
<b>But there was no way of knowing</b>

15:47.860 --> 15:51.200
<b>if I would fall into hell or pierce the blue sky.</b>

15:51.700 --> 15:54.120
<b>And this song allowed me to fly.</b>

15:54.450 --> 15:58.080
<b>I no longer have a place to land, nor the desire to.</b>

15:58.870 --> 15:59.700
<b>You know,</b>

16:01.500 --> 16:05.590
<b>back then, I really wanted to end my life.</b>

16:11.380 --> 16:13.590
<b>I might not have wings,</b>

16:14.050 --> 16:16.930
<b>and I might be convincing myself that I know how to fly,</b>

16:18.260 --> 16:21.140
<b>but I'm at peace with myself.</b>

16:21.730 --> 16:25.900
<b>I can say it with my head held high. Here I am, the real me.</b>

16:31.360 --> 16:32.280
<b>Alright.</b>

16:33.150 --> 16:35.320
<b>But eat before you take off.</b>

16:38.620 --> 16:40.750
<b>Here, lotus root curry.</b>

16:41.160 --> 16:42.210
<b>Did you miss it?</b>

16:43.460 --> 16:45.000
<b>- Are we eating here?
- Why not?</b>

16:45.420 --> 16:48.130
<b>You know we have rules.</b>

16:49.550 --> 16:50.760
<b>Don't worry about that.</b>

16:51.260 --> 16:54.880
<b>Since you left, things have been weird.</b>

16:55.680 --> 17:00.060
<b>Imagine dad started drinking beer, even though he can't handle alcohol.</b>

17:01.140 --> 17:02.640
<b>He was completely wasted.</b>

17:05.150 --> 17:06.520
<b>"What do I do, huh?"</b>

17:07.770 --> 17:08.610
<b>I swear.</b>

17:10.730 --> 17:12.280
<b>He's worried about you.</b>

17:13.610 --> 17:16.660
<b>He may be a renowned researcher,</b>

17:16.820 --> 17:19.410
<b>but he still needs advice.</b>

17:20.490 --> 17:22.950
<b>By the way, this round trip,</b>

17:23.330 --> 17:26.790
<b>mom gave it to your friends in secret.</b>

17:27.460 --> 17:28.750
<b>You didn't know that, huh?</b>

17:29.670 --> 17:32.380
<b>You know… Our family cares about you.</b>

17:33.010 --> 17:37.050
<b>Our parents are clumsy, but they love you.</b>

17:37.800 --> 17:39.350
<b>Keep that in mind.</b>

17:41.770 --> 17:42.890
<b>Enjoy your meal.</b>

17:44.270 --> 17:46.560
<b>I'm glad you're still alive.</b>

17:47.400 --> 17:49.440
<b>I love you too, Nina.</b>

17:52.690 --> 17:53.610
<b>It's spicy.</b>

17:54.240 --> 17:57.660
<b>Has his curry always been this spicy?</b>

18:00.240 --> 18:01.580
<b><i>Family Principles</i></b>

18:08.120 --> 18:11.460
<b><i>Nina, 10 years old</i></b>

18:14.460 --> 18:17.880
<b><i>Everything is so white Everything is so slow</i></b>

18:18.050 --> 18:23.770
<b><i>All the answers are empty of substance</i></b>

18:26.770 --> 18:29.100
<b>Is this the song you like?</b>

18:30.980 --> 18:31.560
<b>Yes.</b>

18:32.690 --> 18:33.570
<b>I see.</b>

18:34.860 --> 18:35.490
<b>You don't like it?</b>

18:36.490 --> 18:37.610
<b>Of course not.</b>

18:40.700 --> 18:41.830
<b>It's not bad.</b>

18:45.040 --> 18:46.200
<b>Not bad at all.</b>

18:47.830 --> 18:48.750
<b>Dad.</b>

18:50.040 --> 18:54.550
<b>Sorry for being so selfish and not listening to you.</b>

18:56.010 --> 18:58.630
<b>Try to cut back on smoking.</b>

19:07.930 --> 19:10.480
<b><i>I'm leaving. I'm going.</i></b>

19:11.150 --> 19:12.060
<b><i>Goodbye.</i></b>

19:13.480 --> 19:14.020
<b>Nina!</b>

19:16.150 --> 19:17.030
<b>Wait.</b>

19:18.650 --> 19:19.200
<b>What?</b>

19:21.450 --> 19:22.740
<b>What's up?</b>

19:25.120 --> 19:26.160
<b>Be careful.</b>

19:30.750 --> 19:31.330
<b>I promise.</b>

19:32.290 --> 19:33.130
<b>Nina!</b>

19:35.130 --> 19:36.460
<b>Don't forget your keys.</b>

19:37.460 --> 19:38.260
<b>My keys?</b>

19:41.590 --> 19:42.340
<b>Why?</b>

19:42.890 --> 19:43.930
<b>Thank your dad.</b>

19:54.610 --> 19:55.730
<b>Dad!</b>

19:59.820 --> 20:03.280
<b>I'm going to sing a song with lyrics I wrote.</b>

20:03.450 --> 20:05.120
<b>Come and listen.</b>

20:06.740 --> 20:07.580
<b>I promise.</b>

20:08.870 --> 20:09.370
<b>Great.</b>

20:10.540 --> 20:11.210
<b>Nina.</b>

20:15.670 --> 20:16.800
<b>I'm off!</b>

20:17.670 --> 20:19.130
<b>And thanks for the branch!</b>

20:20.630 --> 20:21.880
<b>Take care!</b>

20:25.140 --> 20:28.890
<b><i>They have a knack for annoying me, getting on my nerves…</i></b>

20:29.810 --> 20:30.890
<b><i>but I love them.</i></b>

20:32.100 --> 20:34.350
<b><i>Goodbye. I'll be back soon.</i></b>

20:36.060 --> 20:38.150
<b><i>Thank you for choosing our company.</i></b>

20:38.570 --> 20:40.530
<b><i>For connecting flights…</i></b>

20:42.320 --> 20:45.660
<b>**EMPTY AND CATHARSIS**</b>

20:43.950 --> 20:45.660
<b>Miss? Miss!</b>

20:45.820 --> 20:46.620
<b>Sorry!</b>

20:47.080 --> 20:48.740
<b>Oh, I recognize you.</b>

20:49.120 --> 20:50.620
<b>Did you sleep well?</b>

20:51.120 --> 20:51.710
<b>Yes!</b>

21:03.800 --> 21:05.180
<b>I'm back.</b>

21:16.600 --> 21:17.230
<b>Nina.</b>

21:23.570 --> 21:24.530
<b>And our gifts?</b>

21:26.610 --> 21:27.280
<b>You're here.</b>

21:28.660 --> 21:29.530
<b>Why?</b>

21:30.660 --> 21:34.580
<b>Well, Momoka was sure you'd come back.</b>

21:35.120 --> 21:36.830
<b>And if not,</b>

21:37.000 --> 21:40.050
<b>she would have dragged us to Kumamoto.</b>

21:41.050 --> 21:43.970
<b>She was ready to drive herself.</b>

21:44.720 --> 21:47.340
<b>And it would have been Rupa's time to shine.</b>

21:47.800 --> 21:49.640
<b>You were on board, right?</b>

21:50.140 --> 21:51.510
<b>And there she goes, whining.</b>

21:51.680 --> 21:53.270
<b>Those are definitely tears, huh?</b>

21:53.430 --> 21:55.520
<b>No, she's not crying at all.</b>

21:55.690 --> 21:57.100
<b>What do you think, Rupa?</b>

21:58.520 --> 21:59.770
<b>I'm not sure.</b>

22:01.150 --> 22:03.070
<b>Thank you, girls.</b>

22:11.330 --> 22:12.120
<b>I'm back.</b>

22:14.750 --> 22:15.710
<b>Welcome back!</b>

22:15.870 --> 22:17.040
<b>So, have you made progress?</b>

22:17.500 --> 22:20.380
<b>Yes, I wrote the lyrics of the century.</b>

22:27.470 --> 22:29.930
<b>Nina Iseri: Rina Momoka Kawaragi: Yûri</b>

22:31.550 --> 22:34.930
<b>Subaru Awa: Mirei Tomo Ebizuka: Natsu</b>

22:35.980 --> 22:39.350
<b>Rupa: Shuri Tomo Ebizuka: Natsu</b>

23:43.080 --> 23:46.090
<b>Translation & Subtitles: JSICMF Proofreading: Sarah Courchay</b>

23:47.920 --> 23:50.220
<b><i>Next: "The Center of the World".</i></b>
